{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"id":1,"title":2,"inWords":3,"equation":4,"parameters":5,"outputs":15,"results":17,"assumptions":20,"buildsOn":23,"sameDomain":27,"citation":46,"learnMore":47},"vis-viva","활력 방정식 — 궤도 속도","비스비바 방정식은 궤도의 에너지 장부입니다: v = √(μ(2/r − 1/a)). 반장축이 a인 궤도 위의 임의의 점 r에서 — a는 타원의 가장 긴 지름의 절반입니다 — 그 지점의 속도를 알려 줍니다. 원궤도 카드는 a = r인 특수한 경우일 뿐입니다.","\u003Cspan class=\"katex-display\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-mathml\">\u003Cmath xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\">\u003Csemantics>\u003Cmrow>\u003Cmi>v\u003C/mi>\u003Cmo>=\u003C/mo>\u003Cmsqrt>\u003Cmrow>\u003Cmi>μ\u003C/mi>\u003Cmrow>\u003Cmo fence=\"true\">(\u003C/mo>\u003Cmstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\">\u003Cmfrac>\u003Cmn>2\u003C/mn>\u003Cmi>r\u003C/mi>\u003C/mfrac>\u003C/mstyle>\u003Cmo>−\u003C/mo>\u003Cmstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\">\u003Cmfrac>\u003Cmn>1\u003C/mn>\u003Cmi>a\u003C/mi>\u003C/mfrac>\u003C/mstyle>\u003Cmo fence=\"true\">)\u003C/mo>\u003C/mrow>\u003C/mrow>\u003C/msqrt>\u003C/mrow>\u003Cannotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = \\sqrt{\\mu\\left(\\dfrac{2}{r} - \\dfrac{1}{a}\\right)}\u003C/annotation>\u003C/semantics>\u003C/math>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-base\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mrel\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"katex-base\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:3.04em;vertical-align:-1.1561em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord sqrt\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist-r\">\u003Cspan class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8839em;\">\u003Cspan class=\"svg-align\" style